mjs:54-62 断言 m2-planned 默认退出 0、m4-nocache 默认退出 1 且 defects.missing_fixed...a5-nocache；check-defects.mjs:104-111 默认模式仅对 covered 要求 [fixed]；ci-results.json:340 执行块按口径采信。\" },\r\n    { \"id\": \"A74-05\", \"passed\": true, \"evidence\": \"milestone-gate.test.mjs:64-81 断言 M1=0、M2=1/missing、M5=1/defects.set_mismatch、M9=2；check-defects.mjs:96-102,105-107；ci-results.json:349 执行块按口径采信。\" },\r\n    { \"id\": \"A74-06\", \"passed\": true, \"evidence\": \"milestone-gate.test.mjs:83-91 断言缺 --milestone 与 M9 均退出 2；milestone-gate.mjs:133-155；ci-results.json:358 执行块按口径采信。\" },\r\n    { \"id\": \"A74-07\", \"passed\": true, \"evidence\": \"只读 checkDefects(根,索引)={errors:[],absent:true}（默认放行），checkDefects(...,{milestone:'M1'}) errors=['defects.file_missing']（严格模式阻断）；check-defects.mjs:43-45,181-196；ci-results.json:367 执行块按口径采信。\" },\r\n    { \"id\": \"A74-08\", \"passed\": true, \"evidence\": \"ci-results.json:376 三个 a3-runner 测试通过、fail 0、退出 0，[repro] 与 [fixed] 两行 True；test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs:20,26,36。\" },\r\n    { \"id\": \"T-01\", \"passed\": true, \"evidence\": \"ci-results.json:385 精确输出 T-001|M1|[\\\"task\\\",\\\"milestone\\\",\\\"entries\\\"]|AC-001:covered:test/unit/runner-selftest.test.mjs;...;AC-074:covered:test/unit/milestone-gate.test.mjs|false；test/traceability/T-001.json:1-11 仅三键、五个 covered AC、无 baseline。\" },\r\n    { \"id\": \"T-02\", \"passed\": true, \"evidence\": \"ci-results.json:34 的 npm test 与 :232 的 npm run check 均以 0 退出，输出全部自测 ✓、fail 0、skipped 0（impl.md:42 记 38 个测试、fail 0）；run-tests.mjs:303-315 完整运行仅在测试全通过且集合相等时退出 0；design.md:108 规定 spec reporter。\" },\r\n    { \"id\": \"T-03\", \"passed\": true, \"evidence\": \"与 V-01 同一只读 HEAD tree/工作树核验：outsideWriteScope=[]、untrackedOutsideExempt=[]、repoArtifacts=[]；未发现仓库 test-results/ 或 files-executed.json。\" }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\n# Task 001 评审（当前轮）\r\n\r\n结论：**pass**。核验 Git SHA：`8164e724374ebdddd1a41e8d5a5688beb48d6828`。逐条核对 `acceptance.md` 的 47 个编号条目，**47/47 通过、0 项无法确认、0 条 finding**。CI（`.collab/tasks/0